{"seq":2,"slug":"world-history","title":"世界史","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/history/world-history","introMarkdown":"# 世界史 简介\n\n世界史是一门以全球视野审视人类文明发展的学科，它超越单一民族国家的框架，关注不同文明之间的交流、冲突与相互影响。从两河流域最早的城市文明到当代的全球化浪潮，世界史追踪的不仅是各大文明各自的演进轨迹，更是它们之间日益紧密的互动网络如何塑造了今天的世界格局。\n\n自学者进入世界史领域时，最重要的思维调整是放弃以某一文明为中心的叙事习惯。无论是以西方为中心的\"进步史观\"还是以中国为中心的\"华夏中心论\"，都会遮蔽其他文明的独特贡献和历史主体性。全球史的视角要求我们在理解每个文明自身逻辑的基础上，关注跨文明的贸易网络、疫病传播、技术扩散和思想交流等\"连接\"力量。\n\n第一章**古代文明**追溯从美索不达米亚和古埃及到希腊罗马和亚洲古代文明的多元起源，分析不同文明在地理环境制约下形成的独特制度和文化模式。第二章**中世纪与近代**关注欧洲封建社会、伊斯兰黄金时代和东亚朝贡体系的并行发展，以及地理大发现如何将分散的区域历史连接成真正的全球史。第三章**现代与当代**聚焦两次世界大战、冷战格局和全球化时代的重大事件与结构性变化。第四章**专题史**从经济、文化和环境三个横截面切入历史，展示跨国和跨时段的主题研究如何补充传统政治叙事的不足。\n\n建议在学习过程中始终保持\"比较\"和\"联系\"两个分析习惯：比较不同文明对类似挑战的不同回应，关注看似孤立的历史事件之间的深层联系。这正是世界史最核心的认知价值。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ancient-civilizations","title":"古代文明","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/world-history/ancient-civilizations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mesopotamia-egypt","title":"美索不达米亚与埃及","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/ancient-civilizations/mesopotamia-egypt"},{"seq":2,"slug":"greek-roman-world","title":"希腊罗马世界","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/ancient-civilizations/greek-roman-world"},{"seq":3,"slug":"asian-ancient-civilizations","title":"亚洲古代文明：印度、波斯等","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/ancient-civilizations/asian-ancient-civilizations"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"medieval-early-modern","title":"中世纪与近代","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/world-history/medieval-early-modern","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"medieval-europe","title":"中世纪欧洲","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/medieval-early-modern/medieval-europe"},{"seq":2,"slug":"age-of-exploration","title":"大航海时代","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/medieval-early-modern/age-of-exploration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"enlightenment-revolution","title":"启蒙与革命","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/medieval-early-modern/enlightenment-revolution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-contemporary","title":"现代与当代","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/world-history/modern-contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"world-wars","title":"世界大战","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/modern-contemporary/world-wars"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-war-era","title":"冷战时代","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/modern-contemporary/cold-war-era"},{"seq":3,"slug":"globalization-age","title":"全球化时代","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/modern-contemporary/globalization-age"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"thematic-history","title":"专题史","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/world-history/thematic-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economic-history","title":"经济史","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/thematic-history/economic-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-history","title":"文化史","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/thematic-history/cultural-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"environmental-history","title":"环境史","url":"/education/university/history/world-history/thematic-history/environmental-history"}]}]}